# This repo is developed on Windows but its shell scripts only ever run inside Linux
# containers. A CRLF shebang makes the kernel look for an interpreter literally named
# "/bin/sh\r", which fails as "bad interpreter: No such file or directory" -- for
# infrastructure/docker/api-entrypoint.sh that means the API container cannot start at all.
# Pin these to LF regardless of anyone's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
